diff --git a/doc/next/6-stdlib/99-minor/net/http/79656.md b/doc/next/6-stdlib/99-minor/net/http/79656.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..ec4bbf09eb
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/next/6-stdlib/99-minor/net/http/79656.md
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+<!-- go.dev/issue/79656 -->
+
+[ProxyFromEnvironment] now prioritizes lowercase proxy environment variables
+(`http_proxy`, `https_proxy`, and `no_proxy`) over the uppercase versions if
+both are set to different values. This change also affects default proxy lookups
+in [DefaultTransport] and [DefaultClient] by extension.
